# Git ignore rules for Hay Day Automation & Bot Suite

# Build outputs & compiled binaries
**/target/
**/build/
**/*.so
**/*.dll
**/*.exe
**/*.o
**/*.obj
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyd
**/__pycache__/

# Large binary files (>50MB)
**/frida_server_x86_64
**/*.apk
**/*.sctx
**/*.sc
**/*.bin
**/*.rar
**/*.7z
**/*.zip

# Large backup dumps, asset packs, and duplicate trees
Backup Projects/
Hell Hole/
Not Working/
Nxrth OG FIles (Dont Touch it)/
waste/
Working FIne/
**/_backup*/
**/Old test the program test/
**/install_time_asset_pack/
**/stage_cache/

# Logs & temp files
*.log
**/*.log
*.tmp
logs/
**/logs/
**/test_logs/
**/error_logs/
node_modules/
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/
# Temporary trash and screen video captures
**/.trashed*
**/screenshot of ui/
**/Assest/screenshot_*
**/Assest/*.mp4
**/screenshot_VID_*
**/.user_uploaded/
